WEBVTT

00:00.020 --> 00:01.540
The season may be over,

00:01.540 --> 00:04.900
but the game of life and leadership never ends.

00:05.020 --> 00:09.620
You've done the work and you've earned this moment.

00:09.620 --> 00:11.940
It's time to celebrate.

00:11.940 --> 00:15.340
Welcome to the Athleader Hall of Fame.

00:15.340 --> 00:17.220
You have everything you need.

00:17.220 --> 00:18.900
You've got this.

00:18.900 --> 00:21.420
Now, make it happen.
